      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OTTO MANN (1) had his second look this course and distance latest and improved on his time claiming a Grade 5 win in 23.01. Should be in this for a long way. ARCANE LEGEND (4) was well off top last time, finishing 5th (30.41) in a Grade 5 at Gosford. Great record here at the trip having never missed the frame including one win. Key runner on best form. KEY JASPER (2) was well back throughout but attacked the line strongly to place, 2.75 lengths from the winner (23.37) at this track in Grade 5. Has never been out of the placings from four starts out of this box. Will give a great sight again. FRANKIE'S ANGEL (6) cannot be ruled out.",
